{"seq":3,"slug":"white-balance","title":"白平衡","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/photography-video/color-science/white-balance","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"color-temperature","title":"色温与光源特性","url":"/l-doc-books/h/photography-video/color-science/white-balance/color-temperature","wordCount":1364,"readingTime":6},{"seq":2,"slug":"mixed-lighting","title":"混合光源与白平衡挑战","url":"/l-doc-books/h/photography-video/color-science/white-balance/mixed-lighting","wordCount":1620,"readingTime":7},{"seq":3,"slug":"creative-white-balance","title":"创意白平衡与色调设计","url":"/l-doc-books/h/photography-video/color-science/white-balance/creative-white-balance","wordCount":1443,"readingTime":6}],"introMarkdown":"# 白平衡 简介\n\n白平衡（White Balance）是将场景中性灰还原为中性灰的过程——它决定了画面的整体色调倾向。本章解析色温的物理定义、混合光源场景的处理策略、以及超越\"正确\"追求创意表达的白平衡运用。从 AWB 算法到手动 K 值设定，白平衡是每一次拍摄都必须面对的第一个色彩决策。\n"}